<title>BANGLADESH: Port conditions update - Bangladesh - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Bangladesh - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>CHITTAGONG, Sept 15 - Container loading/unloading operation not taking place as from 2000, Sept 14 due to pay dispute between dock labourers and the Bangladesh Master Stevedores Association. Five container vessels idle. Negotiations continuing to resolve dispute.</p>
</text>
